    "items": [
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Whoever loves discipline loves knowledge,",
          "but one who hates correction is stupid."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "One who is good obtains favor from the Lord,",
          "but he condemns a person who schemes."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "No one can be made secure by wickedness,",
          "but the root of the righteous is immovable."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A wife of noble character is her husband’s crown,",
          "but a wife who causes shame",
          "is like rottenness in his bones."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The thoughts of the righteous are just,",
          "but guidance from the wicked is deceitful."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The words of the wicked are a deadly ambush,",
          "but the speech of the upright rescues them."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The wicked are overthrown and perish,",
          "but the house of the righteous will stand."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A man is praised for his insight,",
          "but a twisted mind is despised."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Better to be disregarded, yet have a servant,",
          "than to act important but have no food."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The righteous cares about his animal’s health,",
          "but even the merciful acts of the wicked are cruel."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The one who works his land will have plenty of food,",
          "but whoever chases fantasies lacks sense."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The wicked desire what evil people have caught,",
          "but the root of the righteous is productive."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "By rebellious speech an evil person is trapped,",
          "but a righteous person escapes from trouble."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A person will be satisfied with good",
          "by the fruit of his mouth,",
          "and the work of a person’s hands will reward him."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A fool’s way is right in his own eyes,",
          "but whoever listens to counsel is wise."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A fool’s displeasure is known at once,",
          "but whoever ignores an insult is sensible."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Whoever speaks the truth declares what is right,",
          "but a false witness speaks deceit."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "There is one who speaks rashly,",
          "like a piercing sword;",
          "but the tongue of the wise brings healing."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Truthful lips endure forever,",
          "but a lying tongue, only a moment."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Deceit is in the hearts of those who plot evil,",
          "but those who promote peace have joy."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          21
        ],
        "lines": [
          "No disaster overcomes the righteous,",
          "but the wicked are full of misery."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          22
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Lying lips are detestable to the Lord,",
          "but faithful people are his delight."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          23
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A shrewd person conceals knowledge,",
          "but a foolish heart publicizes stupidity."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          24
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The diligent hand will rule,",
          "but laziness will lead to forced labor."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          25
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Anxiety in a person’s heart weighs it down,",
          "but a good word cheers it up."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          26
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A righteous person is careful in dealing with his neighbor,",
          "but the ways of the wicked lead them astray."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          27
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A lazy hunter doesn’t roast his game,",
          "but to a diligent person, his wealth is precious."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          28
        ],
        "lines": [
          "There is life in the path of righteousness,",
          "and in its path there is no death. ,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
